摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"One-stop skills, subagent, MCP and LSP manager for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — compatible with Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Kimi and other agent plugin layouts.","id":"gh:1338615988","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-agent-plugins-market","slug":"Sivan757/dsh-agent-plugins-market","topics":["agent-plugins","agentic-ai","ai-agents","claude","claude-code","codex","cursor","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","hooks","mcp","mcp-servers","plugin-marketplace","skills","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"One-stop skills, subagent, MCP and LSP manager for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — compatible with Claude C"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ode, Codex, Cursor, Kimi and other agent plugin layouts."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Agent Plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"`dsh-agent-plugins-market`"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**A one-stop skills, subagent, MCP and LSP manager inside DeepSeek Harness (DSH).**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Run Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Kimi and agent-plugins suites inside DSH. The plugin reads each layo"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ut in place, so you convert no manifest and copy no file. Install it from the DSH Web GUI, then mana"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ge skills, commands, agent personas, MCP services and LSP servers in one workspace."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"If this plugin is useful to you, a ⭐ on GitHub is appreciated."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"English | 简体中文 | Documentation | npm"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-agent-plugins-market) [](https://github.com/Sivan757/dsh-agent-"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"plugins-market/blob/main/LICENSE)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Quick start · Highlights · Everyday use · Compatibility · FAQ"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Pages"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Market\nAdd sources, preview suites, install and enable."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Skills\nBrowse skills and author your own."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Commands\nManage prompt templates invoked as /name."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Agent personas\nRoles with an exact provider, model and effort."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"MCP services\nCredentials, authorization and connection status."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"LSP servers\nLanguage server configuration and runtime status."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. In the DSH Web GUI, open **Plugins** in the sidebar.\n2. Press **Add plugin**, type `dsh-agent-plu"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"gins-market`, then install it. The same dialog accepts a repository URL or a local directory.\n3. Res"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"tart DSH, then open **Settings → Agent Plugins**.\n4. The market already lists one first-party source"},{"id":"p18s4","text":". Press **Refresh** to fetch its suites. To bring in more, add a source such as `https://github.com/"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"anthropics/claude-plugins-official`.\n5. Open a suite, review its contents, then install it and keep "},{"id":"p18s6","text":"it enabled. Skills appear in the **Skills** tab and in the `/` menu. Answer any credential notice on"},{"id":"p18s7","text":" **MCP services** before you use that suite's tools."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Terminal alternative: `dsh plugin --profile <name> add dsh-agent-plugins-market`. Requirements, prof"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ile configuration and other install options live in the install guide."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Core"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- **Any skill repository works.** Add a Git URL whose repository holds `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"the market discovers it as a suite. No manifest, no conversion, no file copying.\n- **Ten suite layou"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ts.** Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Kimi Code, ZCode, Qoder CLI, GitHub Copilot CLI, Universal `.plugi"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"n/`, agent-plugins and manifest-less skill collections.\n- **Sources and downloads.** Add a Git repos"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"itory, a local directory or an archive, adopt a checkout you cloned yourself, and refresh on demand."},{"id":"p22s6","text":" Pick a global or China mainland mirror, and refresh every source on a 6-hour timer if you want.\n- *"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"*Runtime injection.** Enabled suites add skills to the catalog and slash menu, commands as `/name`, "},{"id":"p22s8","text":"agent personas to the subagent catalog, MCP tools as `mcp__*`, hooks to lifecycle events, and langua"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"ge servers to the `lsp` tool. Installing the plugin is the whole LSP setup.\n- **One workspace.** Nin"},{"id":"p22s10","text":"e tabs cover the market, the instructions injected into a session, the output style that shapes each"},{"id":"p22s11","text":" answer, the resources you author, and the services that run. Every tab has search, filters and a gr"},{"id":"p22s12","text":"ources you author, and the services that run. Every tab has search, filters and a grid or list view."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Advanced"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **MCP OAuth with nothing to declare.** A remote MCP server that answers `401` starts RFC 9728 disc"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"overy, dynamic client registration and PKCE authorization in your browser, and the granted token per"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"sists. OAuth is on by default, so a suite needs no declaration for it.\n- **Per-server MCP control.**"},{"id":"p24s4","text":" Override a declaration without editing its source, switch one tool off, and set the tool-call and s"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"tartup timeouts.\n- **Project and personal resources.** Turn on **Scan project Agent layouts** to rea"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"d skills, commands, roles, MCP servers and hooks from the project's own directories. Author your own"},{"id":"p24s7","text":" under `~/.agents/` as Markdown, and disable a resource without deleting its file.\n- **Per-workspace"},{"id":"p24s8","text":" control.** Each workspace switches the six mounted surfaces off or on, keeps its own resource filte"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"rs, saves a resource-window setup as a favorite that works across projects, and stows tabs it does n"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"ot need into the menu at the end of the tab row.\n- **Hooks that decide, not just observe.** Ten even"},{"id":"p24s11","text":"ts apply what the hook returns: tool deny, ask and allow, added context, corrective feedback, a forc"},{"id":"p24s12","text":"ed continuation, and a real halt for `continue: false`. A hook row opens a declaration card with its"},{"id":"p24s13","text":" event, matcher and timeout, plus a dry run in your home directory. Hook event coverage lists every "},{"id":"p24s14","text":"event and the three reference fields the host cannot apply yet.\n- **Bilingual by default.** The inte"},{"id":"p24s15","text":"rface and the injected prompts follow the host language. Descriptions and documents show the origina"},{"id":"p24s16","text":"l, a translation or both, and stay cached until you clear them."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Everyday use"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The workspace has nine tabs:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Tab             | Use it to                                                                       "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"             | Use it to                                                                           |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Market          | Add sources, preview suites, install or remove them, and switch them on or off. "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"    |\n| Skills          | Browse skills and create or edit your own reusable instructions.          "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"          |\n| Experts         | Save role instructions and model settings, then delegate to them.   "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"                |\n| Shortcuts       | Manage prompt templates invoked as `/name`.                   "},{"id":"p28s5","text":"                      |\n| Connectors      | Add a service or configure an installed one, its credent"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"ials and its authorization. |\n| Language Engine | Add and configure language servers, and read their"},{"id":"p28s7","text":" runtime status.                  |\n| System prompt   | See the AGENTS.md files injected into it, an"},{"id":"p28s8","text":"d create, edit or delete them.          |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The plugin reads ten layout dialects and maps six runtime surfaces. Per-layout support and the manif"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"est priority order are on the compatible plugins page. Evidence: the layout audit and the compatibil"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"y order are on the compatible plugins page. Evidence: the layout audit and the compatibility report."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Reading a layout does not guarantee every behavior of its original platform. Invalid declarations ar"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e diagnosed and skipped, never half-mounted."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
